%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 500ef08f4cfac4121a17369cfd788261, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialScene2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: 'This is the main interface. Let me explain to you each element that you
      will see in the interface. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 0, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: 'On the top left you will see an icon. The icon will show which body part
      of the mech is being powered up. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions: []
  - text: 'Below that is a timer. The timer will show how long you need to execute
      the move in order to successfully power the body part. It also shows a timer
      to get ready and rest in order to not over exert yourself '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: Now on the edge of the lower part of the interface you can see models.
      These models act as a guide so you can power up your mech to its full potential
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions: []
  - text: Moving on to the top right side, is a pause button which you can use to
      stop the game in case of emergency.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions: []
  - text: "Below that is a percentage performance indicator to see how well you\u2019re
      executing a specific move for one duration.  "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions: []
  - text: 'For the main part of the interface, we have the pilot view which shows
      you the pilot executing the moves. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions: []
  - text: Above are labels, the top left most label will display what you have to
      do. It will show three kinds of labels, namely a rest label, a get ready label,
      and a label for which move to perform.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions: []
  - text: Below that is the next move you need to perform to prepare yourself.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions: []
  - text: On the top right most is the current level you are executing.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions: []
  - text: 'Below that is the set number which is the current cycle and how many cycles
      of moves in total you need to perform. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions: []
  - text: 'And Lastly in the bottom middle of the screen is the one of the most important
      parts of the interface which is the synchronization bar. This shows how well
      you are doing the moves and how in sync you are with your mech. The higher
      this is, the better your performance is. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions: []
  - text: 'That''s pretty much it for the mech interface. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions: []
  - text: 'Now take note of this atlas. The exercises that you perform, Atlas, will
      control every aspect of your Titan. It''s not just about strength, but flexibility,
      stamina, and coordination. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions: []
  - text: 'Now take note of this atlas. The exercises that you perform, Atlas, will
      control every aspect of your Titan. It''s not just about strength, but flexibility,
      stamina, and coordination. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions: []
  - text: So, it's a full-body challenge?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: "Yes, Atlas. And as you progress, your Titan's abilities will mirror your
      growth. It\u2019s best that you get a feel for it yourself."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: "I\u2019ll start the simulation mode, and try to see and feel what it\u2019s
      like to sync with your mech."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions: []
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6b8bcbfda178443c79e604803033d404, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 343c418328d874c3a97e80de7850d301, type: 2}
